{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3hjjNKewNzKcGPtM4j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through the frame.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain is old oak, dark with centuries. Iron bands cross my face in patterns that might be runes or might be scars. The keyhole watches like a single black eye.\n\nCold radiates from my surface. Press your palm against me and feel the weight of what I hold back — or hold in.\n\nI do not open easily.\n\nI do not open for everyone.\n\nBut I *am* locked now, which means I acknowledge you stand before me.\n\nWhat do you bring to the threshold?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":142,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}